/* 
* All English description is translated by DeepL Translator. 
* In case of some errors, please refer to the Chinese version.
*/
{
    /*
    *   ###配置结构版本###
    *   [解析] 任何键的新增/删除/改名都必须 +1；插件启动时比对这个值，
    *          版本不同会自动把新模板合并进来（保留你的值，补上缺失项和注释）。
    *          不要手动改这个数字，除非你知道自己在做什么。
    *
    * ###Config schema version###
    *   Bump this whenever a key is added, removed or renamed. On startup CALL compares it with
    *   the shipped template and merges the template in (your values win, missing keys and their
    *   comments are added).
    */
    "version": 1,
    /*
    *   ###是否开启CALL###
    *   [参数](如下)
    *   true  [解析] 启用插件CALL
    *   false [解析] 关闭插件CALL
    *
    * ###Whether to enable CALL###
    * [Parameters] (below)
    * true [Explanation] Enable CALL.
    * false [Explanation] Disable CALL.
    */
    "enable":true,

    /*
    *   ###使用权限管理###
    *   [参数](如下)
    *   "all"       [解析] 所有玩家都可以使用CALL
    *   "op"        [解析] 仅管理员可以使用CALL
    *   "customize" [解析] 自定义可使用CALL的玩家
    *   "file"      [解析] 每次从文件读取权限列表
    *   "tag"       [解析] 游戏内用标签:call_permission指定
    *   [其他]
    *   当选择"customize"时请到userlist.json文件中指定可使用CALL的玩家
    *   或
    *   通过快捷命令添加可使用CALL的玩家，命令如下：
    *       在后台输入：call add 玩家名字
    *       输入后将自动将玩家列入可使用CALL的名单
    *       在后台输入：call ban 玩家名字
    *       输入后将自动从名单中移除该玩家
    *
    * ###Use Permission###
    * [Parameters] (below)
    * "all"         [Explanation] All players can use CALL.
    * "op"          [Explanation] Only op can use CALL.
    * "customize"   [Explanation] Customize the players who can use CALL.
    * [other]
    * When "customize" is selected, please go to the "userlist.json" file to specify the players who can use CALL.
    * or
    * Add CALLable players by shortcut commands as follows:
    * In the console, type: call add <player name>.
    * The player will be automatically added to the list of players that can be used for CALL.
    * In the console, type: call ban <player name>.
    * This will automatically remove the player from the list.
    */
    "permission": "op",
    
    "suvivalModeActive": true,

    /*
    *   ###控制台输出的语言###
    *   [参数](如下)
    *   "zh_CN" [解析] 简体中文
    *   "zh_TW" [解析] 繁体中文 (谷歌翻译)
    *   "en_US" [解析] 英文 (谷歌翻译) 
    *   "ru_RU" [解析] 俄语 (谷歌翻译)
    *
    * ### Language of the console output ####
    * [Parameters] (below)
    * "zh_CN" [Explanation] Simplified Chinese
    * "zh_TW" [Explanation] Traditional Chinese (translated by google)
    * "en_US" [Explanation] English (translated by google)
    * "ru_RU" [Explanation] Russian (translated by google)
    */
    "consoleLanguage": "zh_CN",

    /*
    *   ###开启自动更新###
    *   [说明]
    *   开启后检测到新版则会自动更新插件和数据
    *   true  [解析] 开启
    *   false [解析] 不开启
    *
    * ###Turn on automatic updates###
    * [Description]
    * Auto update plugin and data when new version is detected.
    * true [Explanation] Enable
    * false [Explanation] Not enabled
    */
    "autoUpdate": false,

    /*
    *   ###自动更新地址###
    *   [说明]
    *   用于自动更新时联网下载最新版本，若无法访问请改备用
    *   "github"    [解析] 从github更新
    *   "minebbs"   [解析] 从minebbs更新
    *
    * ###Automatically updating addresses###
    * [Description]
    * Choose where to download the latest version of the automatic update, if default option not accessible, please change it to others.
    * "github" [Explanation] Update from github.
    * "minebbs" [Explanation] Updates from minebbs.
    */
    "updateFrom": "minebbs",

    /*
    *    ###调试模式###
    *   [说明]
    *   用于形状包和本插件的开发调试。
    *   开启后，将运行单元测试，并且可热重载形状包、输出形状包产生的异常
    *   [参数](如下)
    *   true  [解析] 启用
    *   false [解析] 关闭
    *
    * ### Debugging mode ###
    * [Description]
    * Used for development debugging of CALL and shape packs.
    * When turned on, unit tests will be run, and you can hot reload shape packs and output exceptions generated by shape packs.
    * [Parameters] (below).
    * true [Explanation] enable
    * false [Explanation] disable
    */
    "debugMod":false,
    
    /*
    *    ###第一次加载时是否显示字符图标###
    *    [参数](如下)
    *    true  [解析] 显示
    *    false [解析] 不显示
    *
    * ### Whether or not to display the character logo when loading for the first time###
    * [Parameters] (below)
    * true [Explanation] show
    * false [Explanation] do not show
    */
   "displayLogo": true,
   
    /*
    *   ###一个玩家最多可以保存的结构数量###
    *   [参数](如下)
    *   数字
    *   [范围] 
    *   0--200
    *   [建议]
    *   50以内
    *
    * ### The maximum number of structures a player can save###
    * [Parameters] (below)
    * Number
    * [Range] 
    * 0--200
    * [Recommended]
    * Within 50
    */
    "maxSaveStructure": 30,

    /*
    *   ###最大撤销步数###
    *   [参数](如下)
    *   数字
    *   [范围]
    *   0--100
    *   [建议]
    *   10以内
    *
    * ### Maximum number of undo steps###
    * [Parameters] (as follows)
    * Number
    * [Range]
    * 0--100
    * [Recommended]
    * Within 10
    */    
    "maxUndoStep": 5,

    /**
    *   ###视野选取方块的最大距离###
    *   [参数](如下)
    *   数字
    *   [范围]
    *   1--300
    *   [建议]
    *   150
    *
    * ### Maximum distance from the field of view to pick a square ####
    * [Parameters] (below)
    * Numbers
    * [Range]
    * 1--300
    * [Recommended]
    * 150
    */
    "viewMaxDistance": 150,

    /*
    *   ###最大区块加载次数###
    *   [参数](如下)
    *   数字
    *   [范围]
    *   1--50
    *   [建议]
    *   10
    *
    * ### Maximum number of blocks to load ####
    * [Parameters] (below)
    * Number
    * [Range]
    * 1--50
    * [Recommended]
    * 10
    */
    "maxLoadCheckNum": 10,

    /*
    *   ###遍历等待时间###
    *   [参数](如下)
    *   数字 (毫秒)
    *   [范围]
    *   0--10000
    *   [建议]
    *   300
    *   [其他]
    *   该选项决定了粘贴、填充、加载等操作的间隔时间, 若出现加载结构不完全时需将此项数值调大
    *
    * ### Traversal wait time###
    * [Parameters] (below)
    * Number (milliseconds)
    * [range]
    * 0--10000
    * [Recommended]
    * 300
    * [Other] * [Recommended] * 300
    * This option determines the time between pasting, filling, loading, etc. If the loading structure is incomplete, you need to increase the value of this option.
    */
    "traversalWaitTime": 300,

    /*
    *   ###单填充等待时间###
    *   [参数](如下)
    *   数字 (毫秒)
    *   [范围]
    *   0--1000
    *   [建议]
    *   40
    *   [其他]
    *   该选项决定了执行单个填充指令后等待时间, 若出现填充不完全时需将此项数值调大
    *
    * ###Single fill wait time###
    * [Parameters] (below)
    * Number (milliseconds)
    * [Range]
    * 0--1000
    * [Recommended]
    * 40
    * [Other] * [Recommended] * 40
    * This option determines the wait time after executing a single fill command, and should be increased if the fill is incomplete.
    */
    "fillWaitTime": 40,

    /*
    *   ###默认设置###
    *   ###default settings###
    */
    "default": {
        "enable": true,
        "barReplace": 0,
        "barReplaced": 1,
        "saveArea": true,
        "saveUndo": true,
        "saveCopy": true,
        "saveEntity": true,
        "areaTextShow": true,
        "displayArea": true,
        "displayProgressBar": true,
        "loadChuckTip": true,
        "textureSelectorMode": false,
        "displayPos": null,
        "texture": {
            "a": null,
            "b": null
        },
        "items": {
            "onUseItemOn": {
                "call:gear": {
                    "": {
                        "cmds": [
                            "call menu"
                        ],
                        "describe": "⚙ 主菜单\nOpen menu"
                    }
                },
                "call:wand_select": {
                    "": {
                        "cmds": [
                            "call area b ${block.pos.x} ${block.pos.y} ${block.pos.z}"
                        ],
                        "describe": "选区魔杖 · B点\nSelection wand: point B"
                    }
                },
                "call:wand_copy": {
                    "": {
                        "cmds": [
                            "call copy"
                        ],
                        "describe": "复制魔杖\nCopy wand"
                    }
                },
                "call:wand_paste": {
                    "": {
                        "cmds": [
                            "call paste ${block.pos.x} ${block.pos.y} ${block.pos.z}"
                        ],
                        "describe": "粘贴魔杖\nPaste wand"
                    }
                },
                "call:wand_preview": {
                    "": {
                        "cmds": [
                            "call preview click ${block.pos.x} ${block.pos.y} ${block.pos.z}"
                        ],
                        "describe": "预览魔杖（设落点/旋转/潜行确认）\nPreview wand"
                    }
                },
                "call:wand_adjust": {
                    "": {
                        "cmds": [
                            "call preview nudgeface"
                        ],
                        "describe": "调整魔杖（朝点击的那一面挪一格，潜行反向）\nAdjust wand: nudge along the clicked face"
                    }
                },
                "minecraft:clock": {
                    "": {
                        "cmds": [
                            "call"
                        ],
                        "describe": "打开菜单工具\nOpen menu tool"
                    }
                },
                "minecraft:wooden_axe": {
                    "": {
                        "cmds": [
                            "call area set ${block.pos.x} ${block.pos.y} ${block.pos.z}"
                        ],
                        "describe": "选区工具\nSelection tool"
                    }
                },
                "minecraft:shears": {
                    "": {
                        "cmds": [
                            "call area cancel"
                        ],
                        "describe": "取消选区工具\nCancel selection tool"
                    }
                },
                "minecraft:stick": {
                    "": {
                        "cmds": [
                            "call area b ${block.pos.x} ${block.pos.y} ${block.pos.z}"
                        ],
                        "describe": "B点选区工具\nB point selection tool"
                    }
                },
                "minecraft:arrow": {
                    "": {
                        "cmds": [
                            "call area a ${block.pos.x} ${block.pos.y} ${block.pos.z}"
                        ],
                        "describe": "A点选区工具\nA point selection tool"
                    }
                },
                "minecraft:trident": {
                    "": {
                        "cmds": [
                            "call texture a ${block.pos.x} ${block.pos.y} ${block.pos.z}"
                        ],
                        "describe": "材质a选择工具\nTexture a selection tool"
                    }
                },
                "minecraft:blaze_rod": {
                    "": {
                        "cmds": [
                            "call copy"
                        ],
                        "describe": "复制快捷键工具\nCopy tool"
                    }
                },
                "minecraft:bone": {
                    "": {
                        "cmds": [
                            "call paste ${block.pos.x} ${block.pos.y} ${block.pos.z}"
                        ],
                        "describe": "粘贴到点击的位置工具\nPaste to click position tool"
                    }
                },
                "minecraft:wooden_pickaxe": {
                    "": {
                        "cmds": [
                            "give @s ${block.type} 1 ${block.tileData}"
                        ],
                        "describe": "获取点击的方块工具 (需要有give指令权限)\nGet block tool"
                    }
                },
                "minecraft:emerald": {
                    "": {
                        "cmds": [
                            "call block ${block.pos.x} ${block.pos.y} ${block.pos.z} me"
                        ],
                        "describe": "编辑点击的方块\nEdit block tool"
                    }
                }
            },
            "onStartDestroyBlock": {
                "call:wand_select": {
                    "": {
                        "cmds": [
                            "call area a ${block.pos.x} ${block.pos.y} ${block.pos.z}"
                        ],
                        "describe": "选区魔杖 · A点\nSelection wand: point A"
                    }
                },
                "call:wand_preview": {
                    "": {
                        "cmds": [
                            "call preview move ${block.pos.x} ${block.pos.y} ${block.pos.z}"
                        ],
                        "describe": "预览魔杖 · 换落点（潜行 = 取消预览）\nPreview wand: move anchor (sneak = cancel)"
                    }
                },
                "call:wand_adjust": {
                    "": {
                        "cmds": [
                            "call preview pivot"
                        ],
                        "describe": "调整魔杖 · 切换旋转基准\nAdjust wand: switch rotation pivot"
                    }
                },
                "minecraft:trident": {
                    "": {
                        "cmds": [
                            "call texture b ${block.pos.x} ${block.pos.y} ${block.pos.z}"
                        ],
                        "describe": "材质b选择工具\nTexture b selection tool"
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "area": {
            "start": {
                "x": null,
                "y": null,
                "z": null,
                "dimid": null
            },
            "end": {
                "x": null,
                "y": null,
                "z": null,
                "dimid": null
            }
        }
    }
,

    /*
    *   ###选区可视化方式###   (3.2.0 新增 wireframe)
    *   "wireframe"       [解析] 服务端发包画线框，全服可见，不写世界（默认，需要 HologramLib）
    *   "particle"        [解析] 粒子边框，不修改世界
    *   "text"            [解析] 只显示尺寸文字，零世界副作用
    *   "structure_block" [解析] 旧版做法：用结构方块顶替显示（会写世界，已加审计日志可恢复）
    *   "off"             [解析] 不显示
    *
    * ###How the selection is drawn###
    *   "wireframe"       server-side box outline via HologramLib, visible to everyone, no world writes
    *   "particle"        particle outline, never touches the world
    *   "text"            size hint only, zero world side effects
    *   "structure_block" legacy behaviour: temp structure block (journalled, recoverable)
    *   "off"             nothing
    */
    "areaDisplayMode": "wireframe",

    /*
    *   ###内置工具物品###   (3.2.0 新增)
    *   [解析] 是否安装并启用内置工具物品（⚙菜单 / 选区 / 复制 / 粘贴 / 预览）
    *          首次启用需要重启服务器；物品由插件自带的行为包+资源包定义
    *
    * ###Bundled tool items###   (new in 3.2.0)
    *   Install and enable the bundled tool items. The first enable needs a server restart.
    */
    "toolItems": true,

    /*
    *   ###预览倒计时显示###   (3.9.0 新增，3.9.1 起默认全程)
    *   "always"  [解析] 全程显示（默认）
    *   "auto"    [解析] 只在最后 20 秒显示
    *   "off"     [解析] 不显示
    *
    * ###Preview countdown###   (new in 3.9.0, always by default since 3.9.1)
    */
    "previewCountdown": "always",

    /*
    *   ###倒计时用哪种 HUD###   (3.9.1 新增)
    *   "auto"       [解析] 能建 Boss 条就用条，建不出来自动退到动作栏（默认）
    *   "bar"        [解析] 只用 Boss 条（HologramLib）
    *   "actionbar"  [解析] 只用动作栏（不用任何库，最稳）
    *   用动作栏时，预览期间选区文字会让位，不会互相覆盖
    *
    * ###Which HUD shows the countdown###   (new in 3.9.1)
    */
    "previewCountdownHud": "auto",

    /*
    *   ###Boss 条重建模式###   (3.9.4 新增)
    *   [解析] 库的 Boss 条 id 是 64 位值，经 JS 会丢精度而无法再用来更新/删除。
    *          true  = 每秒整条重建一次（条照常倒计时；重建时只会清掉该玩家自己的条，
    *                  若你还有别的插件在用 Boss 条，请改成 false）
    *          false = 不重建，倒计时改用动作栏
    *
    * ###Boss bar rebuild mode###   (new in 3.9.4)
    */
    "previewBossBarRebuild": true,

    /*
    *   ###预览超时(秒)###   (3.2.0 新增)
    *   [范围] 10--600   [建议] 60
    *   [解析] 预览魔杖多久没操作就自动取消
    *
    * ###Preview timeout (seconds)###   (new in 3.2.0)
    */
    "previewTimeout": 60,

    /*
    *   ###预览旋转基准###   (3.5.0 新增)
    *   "inplace"   [解析] 原地：旋转只改框内排布，框停在落点上（默认）
    *   "anchor"    [解析] 绕落点：你点的那一格当竖轴，框会转到相邻象限（可到落点负方向）
    *   用 /ca preview pivot 切换（调整魔杖左键也能切）
    *
    * ###Preview rotation pivot###   (new in 3.5.0)
    *   "inplace"   the box stays on the anchor and only its contents turn (default)
    *   "anchor"    the clicked cell is the vertical axis, so the box swings into the
    *               neighbouring quadrant (offsets may become negative)
    */
    "previewPivot": "inplace",

    /*
    *   ###预览渲染方式###   (3.3.0 新增)
    *   "ghost"      [解析] 真方块预览（HologramLib viewBlock 逐客户端方块覆盖，客户端可见、不写世界）+ 线框
    *   "wireframe"  [解析] 只画线框，不生成方块（老行为，省性能）
    *
    * ###Preview renderer###   (new in 3.3.0)
    *   "ghost"      real block preview via item displays (client side, no world writes)
    *   "wireframe"  outline only
    */
    "previewMode": "ghost",

    /*
    *   ###预览同屏上限###   (3.3.0 新增；3.7.0 起语义变为「窗口预算」)
    *   [范围] 200--200000   [建议] 12000
    *   [解析] 同时最多显示多少个方块。
    *          表面方块 ≤ 这个值：整块全量显示（和以前一样）；
    *          超过：只显示玩家周围 previewRadius 内的方块，按距离由近到远取前 N 个，
    *          玩家走动时窗口跟着走（不再是「超过就不画」）。
    *
    * ###Preview on-screen budget (streaming window)###   (new in 3.3.0; window budget since 3.7.0)
    */
    "previewMaxBlocks": 12000,

    /*
    *   ###预览窗口半径(格)###   (3.7.0 新增)
    *   [范围] 16--192   [建议] 48
    *   [解析] 大建筑进入窗口模式后，以玩家为中心的立方范围半径（N×N×N）
    *
    * ###Preview window radius (blocks)###   (new in 3.7.0)
    */
    "previewRadius": 48,

    /*
    *   ###窗口重算距离(格)###   (3.7.0 新增)
    *   [范围] 2--32   [建议] 8
    *   [解析] 玩家位移超过这么多格，才重新计算一次窗口（越小越跟手、越大越省）
    *
    * ###Window refresh distance (blocks)###   (new in 3.7.0)
    */
    "previewUpdateDistance": 8,

    /*
    *   ###整块解析阈值(格子数)###   (3.7.0 新增)
    *   [范围] 40000--4000000   [建议] 800000
    *   [解析] 选区格子数不超过它：整块解析后按窗口显示；
    *          超过它：自动切「按 64 切片懒解析」，只解析窗口命中的切片（任意大建筑都能看）
    *
    * ###Whole-clipboard parse threshold (cells)###   (new in 3.7.0)
    */
    "previewMaxCells": 800000,

    /*
    *   ###懒解析缓存切片数###   (3.7.0 新增)
    *   [范围] 2--64   [建议] 8
    *   [解析] 懒解析模式下最多缓存多少个已解析的 64 切片（LRU，只淘汰没有在显示的）
    *
    * ###Parsed slice cache (lazy mode)###   (new in 3.7.0)
    */
    "previewSliceCache": 8,

    /*
    *   ###朝向预取(格)###   (3.7.0 新增)
    *   [范围] 0--64   [建议] 16
    *   [解析] 窗口朝玩家水平朝向的那一侧多取这么多格，走动时前方不会出现空白
    *
    * ###Look-direction prefetch (blocks)###   (new in 3.7.0)
    */
    "previewPrefetch": 16,

    /*
    *   ###低精度外壳###   (3.7.0 新增)
    *   [解析] 窗口模式下额外画一层抽样出的「骨架」，站远处也能看出建筑轮廓
    *          懒解析模式没有全局表面列表，此时只有线框
    *
    * ###Low-detail shell###   (new in 3.7.0)
    */
    "previewOutline": true,

    /*
    *   ###外壳抽样步长###   (3.7.0 新增)
    *   [范围] 2--32   [建议] 8
    *   [解析] 每隔多少个表面方块取一个（步长越大越稀，外壳上限固定 1500 格）
    *
    * ###Shell sampling step###   (new in 3.7.0)
    */
    "previewOutlineStep": 8,

    /*
    *   ###预览每轮时间预算(毫秒)###   (3.8.0 新增)
    *   [范围] 2--20   [建议] 8
    *   [解析] 每一轮发方块最多占用多少毫秒；快机器自动多发、慢机器自动少发，
    *          配合 previewBatchSize 的「每轮上限」一起限制，不会卡主线程
    *
    * ###Preview send budget per round (milliseconds)###   (new in 3.8.0)
    */
    "previewTickBudgetMs": 8,

    /*
    *   ###预览每 tick 生成数量###   (3.3.0 新增，3.6.0 起默认值上调，3.8.0 起为每轮上限)
    *   [范围] 50--5000   [建议] 1000
    *   [解析] 每 tick 发多少个方块覆盖，越小越平滑、越大越快画完
    *
    * ###Preview blocks per tick###   (new in 3.3.0, default raised in 3.6.0)
    */
    "previewBatchSize": 1000,

    /*
    *   ###预览可见距离###   (3.3.0 新增)
    *   [范围] 16--256   [建议] 64
    *
    * ###Preview view distance###   (new in 3.3.0)
    */
    "previewViewDistance": 64,

    /*
    *   ###预览方块缩放###   (3.3.0 新增)
    *   [解析] 让一个展示刚好等于一个方块大小；用 /ca preview calib 校准
    *          霍洛格拉姆库文档里方块模式建议 "0.5"
    *
    * ###Preview block scale###   (new in 3.3.0)
    *   The library docs suggest "0.5" for block mode; /ca preview calib settles it.
    */
    "previewBlockScale": "1",

    /*
    *   ###预览方块模型偏移Y###   (3.3.0 新增)
    *   [解析] 单位是【模型单位】(16 = 1 格)，不是格。文档里方块模式的默认姿态是 "-4"
    *
    * ###Preview block model offset Y###   (new in 3.3.0)
    *   MODEL units (16 = 1 block). The documented block-mode pose is "-4".
    */
    "previewBlockOffsetY": "0",

    /*
    *   ###预览方块竖直修正(格)###   (3.3.3 新增)
    *   [范围] -8--8   [建议] 由 /ca preview probe 测量得出
    *   [解析] 单位是【格】，不是模型单位。探测方块高出 N 格，这里就是 -N
    *
    * ###Preview block vertical correction (blocks)###   (new in 3.3.3)
    *   In BLOCKS. Measured with /ca preview probe: landed N cells high -> -N here.
    */
    "previewBlockYCorrection": 0.4149,

    /*
    *   ###线框最远渲染距离###   (3.2.0 新增)
    *   [范围] 16--512   [建议] 256
    *   [解析] HologramLib 线框超过这个距离客户端不再渲染
    *
    * ###Wireframe max render distance###   (new in 3.2.0)
    */
    "holoMaxRenderDistance": 256,

    /*
    *   ###选区尺寸提示刷新间隔(毫秒)###   (2.0.0 新增)
    *   [范围] 250--10000   [建议] 1000
    *
    * ###Selection HUD interval in milliseconds###  [Range] 250--10000  [Recommended] 1000
    */
    "areaTextTipInterval": 1000,

    /*
    *   ###单次放置的方块上限###   (2.0.0 新增)
    *   [说明] 由于 LL3 的 mc.setStructure 会导致崩服，粘贴/生成改为逐方块写入。
    *          超过此上限会拒绝执行并提示，避免单次操作卡死服务器。
    *   [范围] 1000--200000   [建议] 40000
    *
    * ###Max blocks written by one placement###  [Range] 1000--200000  [Recommended] 40000
    */
    "maxPlaceBlocks": 40000,

    /*
    *   ###每批写入方块数###   (2.0.0 新增)
    *   [说明] 每写入这么多方块就让出一次主线程，避免长任务卡 tick 导致玩家超时掉线。
    *   [范围] 50--5000   [建议] 600
    *
    * ###Blocks per batch before yielding the main thread###  [Range] 50--5000  [Recommended] 2000
    */
    "placeBatchBlocks": 2000,

    /*
    *   ###恢复类操作的最大方块数###   (3.0.6 新增)
    *   [说明] 撤销 / 重做 / 粘贴 / 载入 这类"把快照写回世界"的操作，通常会远大于形状生成。
    *          超过此值会拒绝执行并提示（不会破坏已有的撤销快照）。
    *   [范围] 40000--20000000   [建议] 2000000
    *
    * ###Maximum blocks for a restore (undo / redo / paste / load)###  [Range] 40000--20000000  [Recommended] 2000000
    */
    "maxRestoreBlocks": 2000000,

    /*
    *   ###加载远处区块的方式###   (2.0.0 新增)
    *   "poll"     [解析] 只等待，不为加载区块移动玩家
    *   "teleport" [解析] 必要时把玩家临时移到区域上方以强制加载（旧版行为）
    *
    * ###How to force-load remote chunks###
    *   "poll"     only wait, never move the player
    *   "teleport" temporarily move the player above the area (legacy behaviour)
    */
    "chunkLoader": "tickingarea",

    /*
    *   ###等待区块加载的超时(毫秒)###   (3.0 新增)
    *   [说明] 使用 /tickingarea 强制加载，玩家不会被传送。大选区需要生成新区块，等待会更久。
    *   [范围] 500--60000   [建议] 15000
    *
    * ###Chunk load timeout in milliseconds###  [Range] 500--60000  [Recommended] 15000
    */
    "chunkLoadTimeout": 15000
}